Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:12.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:25.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I had one more chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:35.19,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:39.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My arm's intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:49.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My legs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:54.86,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I was stabbed through the chest, \Nbut there's no trace of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:57.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Was it just... a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.86,0:01:03.63,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Oh, I see you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:05.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:11.06,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I'm Woo Jinchul, manager of the \NHunter's Association Surveillance Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:12.30,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,I'm Kang Taeshik.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:16.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What's someone from \NSurveillance want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:19.10,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,For now, let's get your doctor in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:55.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I was unconscious for three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:59.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What about Joohee and Mr. Song? \NAre they okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:00.95,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Yes. Although...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.91,0:03:04.62,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Song Chiyul lost an arm, and as a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.62,0:03:07.23,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,he may have to retire as a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.47,0:03:13.01,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,And Lee Joohee's been traumatized. \NShe's undergoing psychiatric care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.61,0:03:17.76,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Given her condition, I'm not sure \Nshe'll continue as a hunter, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:30.44,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,There were only six survivors of the double \Ndungeon discovered on your expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.23,0:03:34.20,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,A hunter's job is always a dangerous one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:36.63,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,but it's rare to see such a tragic outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:40.20,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,And yet, somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:47.26,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,when the White Tiger Guild arrived on the \Nscene after being alerted by the survivors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:54.70,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,all they found was you, Sung Jinwoo, \Ncollapsed on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:58.93,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,There were no traces of the temple or \Nthe statues the survivors described.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.93,0:04:00.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.72,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Unbelievable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.69,0:04:06.93,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,If there had been the slightest \Ninconsistency between their reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:10.99,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,or if some of the deceased's remains \Nhadn't been found on the scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:13.76,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,it would've cast suspicion \Nonto your group instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.85,0:04:16.81,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Incidentally...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:20.06,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,This is just speculation on our part, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:23.44,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.44,0:04:27.45,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Have you experienced a second awakening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:31.21,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A second awakening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.59,0:04:36.66,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A hunter's power is determined upon awakening,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:38.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and it never changes from that point on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:42.49,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But... on rare occasions, a hunter \Ncan go through a second awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:47.06,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It lets them exceed their previous limits \Nand rise to A or even S-Rank...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:49.55,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe I could, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:52.77,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,This is a mana meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:55.28,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Please place your hand over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.81,0:05:01.53,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,If they really ran into instakill-level \Nmagic beasts, like the survivors said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:03.90,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,then there's no way a low-level hunter \Ncould have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:07.10,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,And for not even a trace \Nto remain of said beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:10.87,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,would imply the presence of an A-Rank—\Nmaybe even S-Rank hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:14.95,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,The most likely explanation is that \NSung Jinwoo underwent a second awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:19.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What's it say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.75,0:05:22.24,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I've awakened again, \Nwhat rank does it put me at now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:27.26,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,My apologies. I'm afraid we \Nmay have been mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:32.61,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,Even E-Ranks usually manage higher than 70...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:34.43,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,He's basically just a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:38.66,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,The dungeon has vanished \Nand can't be explored again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.49,0:05:41.56,DefaultItalics,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,So how did he survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.18,0:05:45.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Aw, man. I got my hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:50.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And I can't help but wonder why \Nthey didn't ask about this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:56.50,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm the only one who can see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.43,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So it's not a touch panel, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:18.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I remember something like this \Npopping up before, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:21.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Jinah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:26.99,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You need to take better care of yourself! \NDo you know how worried I was?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.67,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:33.29,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You always end up a mess, \Neven when everyone else is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.32,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,I get worried, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:38.29,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can't believe I was prepared \Nto leave her behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:38.29,DefaultTop,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,You were out for three whole days this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:40.32,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,What are you smiling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.32,0:06:44.01,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,The next time something like this happens, \NI'm gonna quit school and get a job
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.12,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,so you don't have to be a hunter anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:48.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I know, I know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:50.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But, Jinah... Can you see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.99,0:06:52.22,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:53.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Never mind. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:59.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Listen... You know how sometimes in a game, \Nit says you have unread notifications?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:00.56,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,We're talking about games now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:03.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How do you manage to read them, usually?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:05.21,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Should they be examining your head, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:07.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Jinah, you used to play games \Nall the time, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:11.53,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,I mean, sure. You'd usually \Nopen your message box, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:14.61,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Open the message box...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.44,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Why bring up games all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.44,0:07:19.41,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, y'know, not a lot to do in a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I remember this "Player" stuff \Nbeing mentioned before...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:27.02,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Well, you seem fine, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:27.92,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,I oughta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.41,0:07:32.24,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Sorry about the wait, Song-yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:37.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"This system is designed to assist \Nthe development of the Player."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:42.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Failure to comply with the system \Nmay result in a penalty..."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"The rewards have been delivered"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue what \Nthis is supposed to mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Daily Quest: Strength Training."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:51.85,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:56.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Push-ups, sit-ups, squats, running...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:08:00.41,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Failure to complete the daily quest \Nwill result in an appropriate penalty"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:05.63,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What the hell? \NIf this is a joke, I'm not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.43,0:08:09.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm hospitalized. Where am I gonna \Nget that kind of stamina?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:12.11,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:16.05,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Regarding that hunter, Sung Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:20.06,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,It doesn't appear he's had \Na second awakening, Chairman Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.72,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.72,0:08:27.11,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,We're lucky this incident didn't result in a \Ndungeon break, but something about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.11,0:08:29.01,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,It leaves too many unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:32.49,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Right. It's nothing like any previous case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:35.61,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,Even allowing for how dungeons \Ntend to be full of mysteries....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:39.10,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,I think this'll need to be \Nmarked as a special case
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:41.87,DefaultItalics,Go Gunhee,0,0,0,,and entered into the databank \Nfor further evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:43.39,Default,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:48.30,Default,Kang Taeshik,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.05,0:08:58.26,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,I'd like you to participate in the next \NB-Rank raid as an instructor, Miss Cha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:00.47,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,As an instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.77,0:09:04.71,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,This raid is going to serve as a test \Nand practical training for new recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:05.89,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Can you handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.94,Default,Cha Hae-in,0,0,0,,I have doubts about my ability as a mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:12.12,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,All you need to do is fight \Nhow you normally do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.12,0:09:14.46,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,Everyone will learn from your example.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:17.16,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,That's just how talented you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:23.94,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,The Hunters Guild is one of \Nthe five largest guilds in the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.27,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,but on an international level, \Nwe're unremarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:29.60,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,And while individual ranks can't be increased,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:32.36,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,our collective combat ability can be honed,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:36.18,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,so that we'll be ready when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:45.02,Default,Civillians,0,0,0,,Another gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:49.94,Default,Civillians,0,0,0,,In the middle of the damn road, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:51.70,Default,Mob B,0,0,0,,When are the hunters gonna show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:53.77,Default,Mob C,0,0,0,,I wish they'd take care of it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:09.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A-An earthquake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:23.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A... desert? What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:27.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming? I was just in the hospital—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:37.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Are you... kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.84,0:10:45.86,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:48.10,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:49.96,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,The patient from this room...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How many of them are there, damn it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:16.06,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Two more hours of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:17.96,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,Any sign of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.24,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,No. Not where I looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:21.90,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,I think I'll check the room again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:22.74,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:26.08,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,I doubt he left the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.45,0:11:31.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Can't... keep running...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:59.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A penalty... quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:03.99,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Mr. Sung?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.53,0:12:07.73,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Mr. Sung, are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:13.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm healing nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:15.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I should be able to leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:16.93,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:21.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,After all the worry you caused me, \NI'm expecting to be treated at Chagall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.29,0:12:27.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,All right, time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:31.93,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You want me... for a raid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:36.60,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,Yes. A D-Rank gate appeared \Nin Hapjeong the other day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:39.38,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,and all the guilds have prior engagements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.61,0:12:42.92,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,I understand if you can't, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:46.43,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,We understand what you've \Nbeen through, Hunter Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.50,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:49.25,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,No apologies necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:53.76,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,Oh, that said, I heard that \NSung Jinwoo has woken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:54.97,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,He has?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.31,0:13:06.02,DefaultItalics,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo... He's okay. That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.29,0:13:11.46,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,Look. He's running again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:16.11,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,Honestly... He's been at it every day \Nsince regaining consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:20.28,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:24.25,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,I know hunters are supposed to heal \Nfaster than normal people, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.25,0:13:26.50,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,He says he's trying to get back into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:29.18,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,And he doesn't listen when \Nwe tell him to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.18,0:13:30.85,Default,Nurse B,0,0,0,,Even though he was badly\Ninjured just a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:32.46,Default,Nurse A,0,0,0,,He's a real handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:37.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's been four days since \NI regained consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:38.63,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've figured out a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.52,0:13:42.80,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,First, I'm not hallucinating these windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:47.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,When I complete the daily quest, \NI get three types of rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.07,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Full recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:52.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,All that exhaustion is gone in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:56.53,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Next is the ability points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.97,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can distribute the points \Ninto whatever abilities I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.43,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I should probably go with strength, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:06.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Upgrading my abilities makes me\Nthat much more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:09.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can literally tell that \NI've got more strength now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:12.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've also got these skill \Nand inventory screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:16.22,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My world's taken a real turn \Nfor the strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's like a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:30.16,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And my final daily quest reward... \Nthe random loot box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:31.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wonder what it'll be today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:40.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A key?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:47.41,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've only gotten useless stuff like \Npens and bandages so far...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:51.59,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,An instance dungeon? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:58.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Based on what's happened so far, it'll be \Nsome kind of event to help me get stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:04.84,DefaultItalics,Caster,0,0,0,,And now a report on today's gate conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:08.85,DefaultItalics,Caster,0,0,0,,New D-Rank gates have appeared at these locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:13.72,DefaultItalics,Caster,0,0,0,,The C-Rank gates in the Upper East and \NMidtown areas are currently being dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.28,0:15:17.88,DefaultItalics,Caster,0,0,0,,The B-Rank gate that appeared \Nin the wharf district the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:22.36,DefaultItalics,Caster,0,0,0,,is scheduled to be raided within \Na few days by the Hunters Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:26.38,DefaultItalics,Caster,0,0,0,,Expect traffic delays as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.60,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,That was a really long line, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:30.36,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,It's supposed to be for sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:33.72,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,Understood. I'll head back to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.51,FlashbackTop,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.01,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Mom, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:47.43,Flashback,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:50.39,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's Mom... She won't respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:53.35,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Eternal Sleep Disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.35,0:15:56.91,Flashback,Doctor A,0,0,0,,It's also known as Final Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:16:00.07,Flashback,Doctor A,0,0,0,,It's a disease that came into existence \Nwith the appearance of the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.07,0:16:03.32,Flashback,Doctor A,0,0,0,,It affects roughly one in every \Nseveral ten thousand people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:08.01,Flashback,Doctor A,0,0,0,,There are theories that it's caused \Nby continual exposure to mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:11.95,Flashback,Doctor A,0,0,0,,In any case, the best that modern \Nmedicine can provide is life support.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.29,Flashback,Supervisor,0,0,0,,All right, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:17.25,Flashback,Supervisor,0,0,0,,Step lively now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.43,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:32.14,Flashback,Associate D,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:34.78,Flashback,Associate D,0,0,0,,You qualify to become a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.65,0:16:38.06,Flashback,Associate D,0,0,0,,We're looking forward to \Nseeing what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:43.87,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I did it, Jinah! Now I can \Nafford Mom's treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:45.95,Flashback,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Isn't it dangerous, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.95,0:16:48.95,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It'll be okay. Just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:59.47,Flashback,Hunter A,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.48,Flashback,Hunter B,0,0,0,,Just sit in a corner and don't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:04.72,Flashback,Hunter A,0,0,0,,Damned E-Rank, slowing us down...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:11.90,Flashback,Hunter A,0,0,0,,And for the record, if you don't \Ncontribute, you don't get a cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.93,0:17:15.48,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being so useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:20.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll put my ability points into strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:35.92,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've got my gear ready. \NI've taken care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.24,0:17:39.17,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And I'm confident that I can \Nrun away if I need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:42.65,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If things get dangerous, like last time, \NI'll get the hell out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:26.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:30.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The exit's been sealed off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.29,0:18:40.81,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I see. So I'm in a separate dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:44.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Instance dungeons aren't \Nlike the regular kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:49.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've never been into one myself, \Nbut I bet they're like red gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:53.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What a mess. I was thinking \NI could run, if I had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:55.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But that's out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:59.40,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"Teleportation stone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:03.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What's that? I guess I'm stuck here \Nuntil I can clear the dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:06.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I couldn't even beat E-Rank beasts before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:09.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And now I have to clear a dungeon by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:10.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:16.31,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Can I really beat a boss without any party?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.12,0:19:19.57,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Still, I don't have a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:33.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What do I do? I'm suddenly \Nfeeling less confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:41.37,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Here they come! And there's three!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.48,0:20:34.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I beat one...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:58.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've gotten stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:11.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:13.48,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can sense it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:18.34,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This one's way stronger than those goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:23.83,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My legs... won't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.06,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:28.78,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Am I afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.24,0:21:31.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I didn't think I was traumatized...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.51,0:21:34.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:43.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's no healer with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:46.58,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I get injured here, I'm done for!
